    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25910" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lārĭus</span></b> , ii,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a lake in</i> Gallia Cisalpina, <i>on which</i>
			Comum <i>lay</i>, now <i>Lago di
			Como</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 2, 159</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. Ep. 9,
				7, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 19, 23, §
			131</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lārĭus</span></b> , a, um, <i>adj., of Larius, Larian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Larium litus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					35, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
